{"images":["data:image/webp;base64,"],"messages":[{"content":"Assume that both X and Y are well-diversified portfolios and the risk-free rate is 8%. <image> In this situation you would conclude that portfolios X and Y:\n\n(A) Are in equilibrium.\n(B) Offer an arbitrage opportunity.\n(C) Are both underpriced.\n(D) Are both fairly priced.\n\nAnswer with the option's letter from the given choices directly.","role":"user"}]}